{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07668","headline":"蓟北行二首 一 · 李希仲","name":"蓟北行二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旄头有精芒，胡骑猎秋草。\n羽檄南渡河，边庭用兵早。\n汉家爱征战，宿将今已老。\n辛苦羽林儿，从戎榆关道。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李希仲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07668.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07668","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}